      <ul>
        <li><a href="/contact/">Contact</a> — request a quote, report a correction, or ask a data question.</li>
        <li><a href="/methodology/">Methodology</a> — the full research, verification and correction method.</li>
        <li><a href="/data-use-and-citation/">Data Use &amp; Citation</a> — how our data may be reused and cited.</li>
        <li><a href="/disclaimer/">Disclaimer</a> — the limits of what we claim.</li>
        <li><a href="/terms-of-use/">Terms of Use</a> — the terms governing use of this site.</li>
        <li><a href="/privacy-policy/">Privacy Policy</a> — what we collect and why.</li>
        <li><a href="/safety-notice/">Safety &amp; Liability Notice</a> — battery hazards and safety responsibilities.</li>
        <li><a href="/accessibility/">Accessibility</a> — our accessibility commitment.</li>
      </ul>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
